            "id": "130245101",
            "speakerId": 12179,
            "speakerName": "观察",
            "text": "（箱子里有一些武器，还有不少药物和绷带，看来他们果然很不安分。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1302453",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
